    - In `args` and `when.lhs/rhs`: `$name` → env lookup; literal otherwise.
    - In `answer[*].message`: `{name}` resolves from env at answer time (same lookup,
      without the `$` prefix).
    - Dotted and indexed paths: `$a.b`, `$rows.0.field`.
    
